        "Content": "Features:\r\n\r\n• Rare and distinctive detached family home\r\n• SOUTH/WEST FACING GARDEN\r\n• Highly sought-after location\r\n• Approximately 1,700 sq. ft. of accommodation\r\n• Set on approximately ¼ acre of private grounds\r\n• Exceptionally private south-facing rear garden\r\n• Mature, secluded and not overlooked\r\n• Large, paved patio area ideal for outdoor entertaining\r\n• Three large double bedrooms, all with en-suite bathrooms\r\n• Private driveway with parking for 4–5 cars\r\n• Excellent entertaining potential\r\n• Significant scope to extend, subject to planning permission\r\n• Approximately 5 minutes’ walk from Douglas Village\r\n• Excellent public transport links to Cork City, UCC, CUH and MTU\r\n• BER D1 - 109855379\r\n• Presented in very good decorative order\r\n• Exceptional combination of privacy, space, convenience and future potential"
